"P3362107314" "One of MAGI's associates was mugged last night, and I have reason to believe it was no random crime. {PERSON_NAME} is a Middling, one of those associates not gifted with the arcane arts. The {ITEM_NAME} the Hellions took from her was no mere heirloom; it was a ward meant to protect her from dark forces. Sadly, it could do little against brute thugs. <br><br>I've done a divination, and I feel the {ITEM_NAME}'s presence in the Smathery & Sons warehouse in Atlas Park. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>{HeroName}, will you find the stolen {ITEM_NAME}?</A>"
