// IntroString :
"P232952326" "The Hellions seem to get a big thrill out of frightening Atlas Park citizens these days. It's getting so bad that people won't leave their houses in groups of fewer than three! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you prevent the Hellions from harassing the civilian populace?</A> If people can't feel safe in Atlas Park, we may truly be losing the battle for this city."
// AcceptString :
"P1606934039" "Prevent the Hellions from harassing the civilian populace"
// SendOffString :
"P2083419292" "The Hellions grow bold, for they still think that the city's heroes are weak. Please show them how wrong they are."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2376765171" "Combat Hellion menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2609495480" "The Hellions are still causing panic on the streets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2128533906" "You have discouraged the Hellions from harassing civilians in Atlas Park."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2836695185" "Soon the Hellions will learn to fear the name of {HeroName}."

