// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3564059852" "A Seer here at MAGI came to me this morning out of grave concern for our associate {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A}. According to this Seer, {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A} is about to suffer a life-threatening incident that can be prevented by a simple warning. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you warn this citizen of the imminent peril?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2165354607" "Warn {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A} of imminent peril"
// SendOffString :
"P3728922665" "Both I and the Entities will thank you for this. You should seek out {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A} in Atlas Park and deliver the following message: <br><br>'Those who walk live yet dead, <br>shall from the Row of Kings make way, <br>Come to bring a mortal dread, <br>and make {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A} pay.<br>In the second shadow of the night, {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A} must take flight.' <br><br>Thank you, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1418762944" "Warn {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A}"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2501231048" "You need to warn {ATLAS_PARK_CONTACT_A} soon!"

