// Dialog :
"P3423174059" "Thanks for the warning, {HeroName}. MAGI's Seers are rarely wrong, and I think I may know what this is about. I'll take precautions. <br><br>Say, before you go, did you see any Hellions on your way here?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2155372975" "The Entities are pleased with your performance today."
